{"rowNumber":1108,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1108","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑が焦った様子で首を横に振る。\nでも、そんなことを言う紫苑も、動きを止めることはなかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1114,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1114","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ひぁぁああっっ～～！！　ダメっ、それダメっ……！！\nグリグリしちゃっ、あああっ、あぁぁぁああああっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1118,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1118","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑がビクビクビク――と身体をのけぞらせる。\nそしてその分、ぼくは腰を浮かせてちんこを膣内へ潜り込ませて行く。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1127,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1127","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ――……！！！\nあああっ、ああっ……！！　あひぁぁぁぁ……！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1131,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1131","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"すると紫苑は息を詰まらせ、身を悶えさせて、\nガクガクと全身を震わせた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1135,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1135","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膣内は激しく収縮し、ちんこが千切れてしまいそうなほど強く\n卑猥な肉壁が竿を締め付けてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1148,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1148","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁっ……あ、あぁぁ……んぁぁぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1151,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1151","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑はそのまま数回ガクガクと身を揺らすと、\n力尽きたかのように腰を落とした。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1155,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1155","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その拍子に彼女の手元からカメラが滑り落ちる。\n慌ててそれをキャッチすると、紫苑が蕩けた顔で見つめてきた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1163,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1163","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1166,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1166","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑がカメラを持ったぼくを無言で眺め続ける。\n「返せ」とも言わず、むしろわざとぼくに手渡したとばかりに。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1171,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1171","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もしやと思ってカメラを構えると、愛液がじゅわっと膣内に溢れた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1178,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1178","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「…………」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1183,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1183","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「っっ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1186,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1186","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"彼女の蕩け顔を写真に収める。\nそんなぼくを紫苑はただじっと見つめていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1190,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1190","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"続けて繋がった場所へレンズを向ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1195,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1195","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「～～っっ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1198,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1198","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"すると紫苑は恥ずかしそうに唇を噛んだ。\nでも、それだけだった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1207,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1207","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ……、んんっ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1210,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1210","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"写真を撮る度に紫苑が可愛く喘ぐ。\n膣内がギュッギュとぜん動して快感に震えているのがわかる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1214,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1214","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくも手がブルブルしてしまうくらい興奮していた。\n紫苑の痴態を写真に収める度に甘い背徳感に心が煽られる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1221,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1221","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁあんっ、あっ、はぁっ、んぁあんっ、あぁああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1227,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1227","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"腰を振る紫苑のトロ顔を撮り続ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1233,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1233","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"顔だけじゃない。結合部も、おっぱいも、\nセックス中の息づかいすらもファインダーに収めていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1238,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1238","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「撮らっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！　撮られちゃってるっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1242,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1242","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「私の恥ずかしい姿っ、あっ、はぁんっ、んぁああっ！\nたくさんたくさんっ、ああっ、撮られちゃって……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1247,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1247","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「、私とイケナイことしてる証拠っ……！\nあっ、はっ、あっ、あぁんっ、残しちゃって……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1251,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1251","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑の身体が激しくビクつき始める。\nシャッターを切るほど快感が膨れあがっているのがわかる――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1257,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1257","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、ダメっ、あああっ、ダメぇ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1261,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1261","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ま、またイっ――んんんんっっ！！　イっちゃっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1265,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1265","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「見られて、撮られてっ、ああああっ……！！\nはしたない、イき顔っ、あっ、あっ、あっ、んんっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1270,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1270","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「恥ずかしいっ、ダメっ、ふぁあああっ、ダメぇ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1273,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1273","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑がブンブンと首を横に振って懇願してくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1276,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1276","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"だけど、その羞恥に悶える姿が\nぼくにとっては最高のスパイスになってしまっていて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1282,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1282","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁああああああっっ～～！！！\n激しっ、あああっ、ダメっ、ダメダメダメぇっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1287,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1287","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イくっ、んぁああああっっ！！　んああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1291,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1291","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「誰にも、見せちゃ、イケない、顔なの、にぃ……ああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1294,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1294","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そして必死に絶頂を我慢しようとする紫苑に、\nぼくはしっかりとレンズを向けて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1310,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1310","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「んん、んあ、あああああぁぁぁぁっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1313,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1313","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そのイき顔を捉えた。\n紫苑の絶叫に合わせて、シャッターを切った。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1317,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1317","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"瞬間――頭の中が沸騰するような背徳感に駆られる。\nその歪んだ気持ちがぼくの腰を押し上げていく――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1330,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1330","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ひぃああんっ！？　ちょっ――あぁああんっっ！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1334,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1334","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「動くっ、ああああっ、ダメっ……！！\nイったっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、イったばかり、でぇ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1339,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1339","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ひぃああぁんんっ！！　とめっ、あひぁっ、ひっ、んぁあっ！！\n一旦っ、おちんちっ、ああああっ、あああああっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1343,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1343","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"絶頂の余韻に浸る間も与えず、紫苑の膣内を突き続ける。\nよだれを零しながら喘ぐ紫苑の顔が綺麗だった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1351,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1351","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「バっ――とっ、撮るっ、撮るなぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1355,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1355","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「お願いだからっ、あぁああんっ、こんな顔っ、撮らないでぇ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1358,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1358","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"言葉とは真逆に紫苑の身体はどんどん火照ってくる。\n膣内は大洪水を起こしていて、ひと突きごとに飛沫が弾ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1363,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1363","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！！\nダメっ、んぁああああっ！！　またっ、あああっ、またぁーー！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1377,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1377","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ん゛っ――ん゛んんんんんんんんんっっ～～！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1380,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1380","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑がガクガク――と身悶えしながら再び絶頂する。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1383,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1383","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その姿も余さずファインダーへ残していく――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1389,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1389","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁぁぁぁぁぁ……！！！　ダメっ、あああっ……！！！\n頭っ、あっ、はぁっ、んぁっ、変になるっ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1394,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1394","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「きもち、よす、ぎてっ……！！\nあっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！　なにも考えられな、ひっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1398,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1398","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ついには呂律も回らなくなって、顔も蕩けきってしまう。\nそして快楽を貪るように紫苑も腰を振り返してきた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1407,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1407","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁあんっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、はぁあんっ……！！\nきもちいいっ、んぁああっ、おちんち、ああっ、いいっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1412,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1412","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「また、んふぁああっ、あっ、はぁっ、ああああっっ！！\nまたイくっ！　イくっ！！　イくイくイくぅぅ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1426,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1426","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふあぁぁぁあああああっっ～～！！！\nあああっ、ああっ、ああぁぁぁぁああああっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1430,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1430","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もはや喘ぎ声を堪えることもなく紫苑が絶頂する。\nその悦に浸りきった顔をぼくは写真に収め、目に焼き付けていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1441,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1441","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ……！　んっ、んんっ……！！\nんはぁっ、あっ、はぁんっ、ひぃあっ、あぁんっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1446,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1446","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あ……んっ、ふ、んっ、ふあ、ああああ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1450,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1450","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「んぁ、ああっっ……！！　まるみえくん、に……\n私のスケベな顔っ、あああっ、見られて、るっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1454,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1454","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"自分の愛液で濡れたカメラを見つめながら、\n紫苑がいやらしい嬌声を上げ続ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1458,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1458","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんな紫苑の姿を、愛液で曇ったレンズ越しに\n何枚も何枚もぼくは撮り続けた……それが紫苑の望みだといわんばかりに。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1464,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1464","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！\nごめんっ、ごめんねっ、まるみえくんっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1470,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1470","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「まるみえくんの、頭の中っ、あっ、はぁっ……！\n私のスケベな姿で、いっぱいに、しちゃって……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1475,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1475","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁぁっ、でもっ、ああああっ、きもち、いいっ……！！\nまるみえくんに、残っちゃう、のに……ああああっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1481,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1481","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！\nま、またっ、ああああっ、またイくっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1486,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1486","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「まるみえくん、に……！！　私がイってるの、焼き付いちゃう……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1489,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1489","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑が前のめりになりながら愛機のレンズを見つめる。\nこれでもかというほど蕩けた顔を突き出してくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1494,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1494","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁあああっ！！　ああああっっ！！\nあああっ、んぁあああああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1499,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1499","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イくっ――イく、イくイくっっ！！！\nはぁ、あああああああああっっ～～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1513,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1513","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イ――くぅぅぅぅぅぅぅぅううううっっ～～！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1516,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1516","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑が恥も外聞もなくイき狂う。\nシャッター音が仄暗い体育倉庫に響き渡る。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1520,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1520","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もっとスケベな紫苑の姿を写真に収め続けたい。\nだけど、イきまくる紫苑の膣内の締め付けと収縮に、ぼくも限界が近い。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1531,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1531","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「――くはぁあんっ！！？　あぁあんっ！！\nあっ、あっ、あっ、はげひっ、あああっ、急にはげしっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1536,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1536","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、はぁはぁっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1539,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1539","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくもイきたい。紫苑みたいに欲望をぶちまけたい。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1543,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1543","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁっ、あっ、はぁっ、んぁあああっっ！！！\nおまんこ壊れ、ひゃっ、はげしっ、ふっ、うっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1548,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1548","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「おちんちん、ふぁぁああんっ！！\nおまんこっ、ジュボジュボしてくるぅ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1552,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1552","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"より快感を貪るためか膣の締まりがさらに強くなる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1555,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1555","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膣内は沸騰したみたいに熱くて、\nドロドロの粘液がちんこに絡みついて来ていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1560,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1560","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「んんんっっ！！！　ふふふっ……！！\nおちんちんっ、あはぁっ、ビクビクしてるっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1565,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1565","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふ、ふふっ、イっちゃうんだっ？\n私のおまんこでっ、あっ、あっ、イきそうなんだ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1570,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1570","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「この前みたいにっ、あっ、はぁっ、\n私のおまんこの中っ、えっちぃお汁でいっぱいにしちゃうの？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1575,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1575","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イケナイことなんだよっ？　従妹のおまんこに中出しするなんてっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1579,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1579","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ここに来て挑発してくる紫苑が可愛くて、小憎たらしい。\nそんな天邪鬼な姿がぼくの射精感をより強く奮い立たせてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1585,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1585","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふあぁああああああああっっ～～！！！？\nぐりっ、ああああっ、子宮にグリグリきてぇ……！！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1590,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1590","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「そそぎこむつもりなんだ……？\n私の赤ちゃんの部屋に、精子そそぎこんじゃうんだ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1595,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1595","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「妊娠しちゃうかも？　孕んじゃうかもよ？\nいいのっ？　あっ、あっ、あっ、いいのっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1599,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1599","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"煽られる度にちんこが震える。\n今更抜くことなんて、とてもできそうになかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1604,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1604","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁああっ、あああああっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1608,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1608","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「きてっ、んぁあああっ、きてるっ……！！\nおちんちんの奥から、精子のぼってきてるぅっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1613,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1613","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ああ、あああ……！　出す、気だ……\nこのまま、出すんでしょ……無理やり、んあああっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1617,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1617","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"最後の最後まで紫苑が罵倒してくる。\n蕩けきった声と顔で、全力で腰を振りながら。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1621,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1621","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんな彼女の挑発に乗るように、\nぼくは力一杯、紫苑の身体を突き上げて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1640,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1640","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「んぁぁああああああああああああああっっ～～！！\nあああっ、ああああああっ、ふぁあああああっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1644,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1644","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"カメラのシャッターを切りながら、\n紫苑の膣内があっという間に溢れるほどの精を注ぎ込んだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1649,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1649","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あつひっ……！！　焼けっ……！！\nおまんこっ、あああああっ、溶かされちゃぁ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1654,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1654","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「きもち、いいっっ……！！　射精、きもちいっっ……！！\nこの感触、んんんんっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1659,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1659","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"恍惚とした顔で喘ぎながら紫苑が精子を搾りあげていく。\n淫欲にまみれたその姿もカメラの中に収め続ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1663,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1663","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"背徳感溢れるこの撮影は快感そのもので、\nぼくは射精中もずっと撮影に精を出し続けた――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1679,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1679","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「んふぁ……！　はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1683,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1683","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1686,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1686","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もわっとした熱気が体育倉庫に立ちこめる。\n気づけば、ぼくも紫苑も汗だくになっていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1690,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1690","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"寝転がっていたマットにも大きな染みができている。\n汗と愛液と精液で驚くほどビショビショになっていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1695,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1695","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ……し、しちゃった、ふふふ……。\nまたセックス、んんっ、しちゃったや……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1700,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1700","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「し、紫苑……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1703,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1703","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"絶頂の余韻が続く中、紫苑が朦朧とした様子で呟く。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1707,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1707","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんには、はぁはぁ、秘密……だよ？\n言ったら、はぁはぁ、写真見せちゃうからね……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1712,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1712","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「私のおまんこに、はぁはぁ、中出ししちゃってる写真……。\nこんなに溢れちゃうくらい出しちゃった写真、見せるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1717,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1717","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「っ……う、うん……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1720,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1720","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑にそう言われたことで、\n今になって自分のしでかしたことに焦ってしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1724,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1724","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくってやつは、また性欲に流されてしまったんだ……。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1729,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1729","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「……ふふ。二人だけの秘密、また増えちゃった……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1733,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1733","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「え？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1737,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1737","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ううん。なんでもない」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1740,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1740","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"焦るぼくとは裏腹に、紫苑は妙に嬉しそうな顔をしていた。\n痴漢の仕返しができて満足したってことかな……？","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1744,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1744","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それとも――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1748,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1748","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ねぇ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1752,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1752","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「な、なにっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1756,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1756","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「声上擦らせないでよ……。\nもしかして、まだヤり足りないの？　この変態」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1761,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1761","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「いやいや、そんなことないってば……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1766,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1766","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「そう？　なら私が戻ってくるまでに後片付けしておいてね。\n匂いとかちゃんと取らないとマズいだろうし」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1771,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1771","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「戻るまでって……。紫苑はどこに行くの？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1775,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1775","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「プール横の更衣室。シャワー室が併設されてるから。\n安心して。片付けが終わったら使わせてあげる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1779,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1779","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その普段通りのクールな紫苑の様子を見て、\nぼくはまたわからなくなってしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1783,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1783","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑は一体、ぼくのことをどう思ってるんだろう？","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1787,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1787","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ちゃんと証拠が残らないように片付けてね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1791,"id":"si10_02h.ks#1791","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ここでのコトは、二人だけの――秘密だから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
